        "stable_field_key": "fa870ac8-fe01-5caf-88f0-06fd6a3c2318",
        "sort_order": 0,
        "field_type": "richtext",
        "label": "Before your website build",
        "internal_label": "source_165_field_1",
        "placeholder": null,
        "help_html": "<p>For a WordPress and Elementor build, you need your own domain, hosting, WordPress installation and Elementor license when the site is transferred. A WooCommerce license applies to the WooCommerce package. If you need help arranging these, tell the team. Do not enter license keys, passwords or access tokens in this form; the team will coordinate access and license activation separately.</p>",
